A.1  Nature of this repository.
     "umaa-cpp" (the "Project") is a derivative work based on the Unmanned
     Maritime Autonomy Architecture (UMAA) Interface Definition Language (IDL)
     Software and Data (the "UMAA Software and Data") originally obtained from
     the AUVSI public website under Distribution Statement A (Approved for
     Public Release; Distribution Unlimited).

A.2  The original terms still govern the base.
     The UMAA Software and Data, and any portions of it that appear in this
     repository in original or modified form, remain governed by the UMAA IDL
     Software Terms of Use Agreement ("the TOU"), reproduced in full in PART B
     below. Per Article 3.1 of the TOU, those terms flow down to, and bind,
     any entity that receives the contents of this repository, including
     anyone who clones, forks, downloads, or mirrors it.

